o you. We would also appreciate it if you could make her look like a life-size standing picture.\n\nIntended use\nWe would like to use the illustrations for posting on X (formerly Twitter), posting on the YouTube community, and as thumbnails and eye catchers on the delivery screen.\nTherefore, if possible, we would appreciate it if you could provide us with the illustration and background in a psd format with separate layers.\n\nReference materials\nHayanochika\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lLX3AJTGW7aUXkPyv8d2nb9eVXK_Unru\nThis is the history of the avatar by date. Basically, she is a red-haired, blue-eyed cat, so you can draw her as you like.\n\nI would also like to monetize my YouTube channel when it becomes available, so this will be a commercial use. We would appreciate it if you could describe in a separate layer if there are any NG conditions regarding the use of the image.\n\nWe would be happy to accept your request. Thank you in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lLX3AJTGW7aUXkPyv8d2nb9eVXK_Unru", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Illoshino/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2127236, "client_id": 1238329, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/044f0346/uploads/origins/968d6c41-f1dd-4b3d-be8b-952039c92c21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6590b2a864d9a7eb5528c7c49a86f03b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/044f0346/uploads/origins/968d6c41-f1dd-4b3d-be8b-952039c92c21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6590b2a864d9a7eb5528c7c49a86f03b, https://si.imgix.net/044f0346/uploads/origins/968d6c41-f1dd-4b3d-be8b-952039c92c21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf27a77655b21cfb7ef1b03da15c02cd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/044f0346/uploads/origins/968d6c4