rop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b8bee6d166f87551fdfcdfb9144e0b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fc88797e/uploads/origins/c3f5b225-ce44-41a5-9b90-76bea7483856?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f4045b9671b7e2190c6efae270eb596f 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, and thank you very much for your very kind appeal.\nI would very much like to request an illustration of my favorite Vtuber, Akua Mizuki (@mzsr_akua).\nSince Chiyou Oshino-sama likes ribbons and frills, we would like to request Akua's April Fool's Day project costume. (We apologize that the hair color is red and white, which is a departure from the light blue and pink that you praised in your appeal.)\nPlease excuse the bullet points below.\n\nFacial features and hair style...please refer to the reference image (1) in the URL below. If you have difficulty seeing the details of the costume, please check the attached URL from 34:36 to 39:12.\nPose, background, composition...We will leave it to you to draw what you are comfortable with.\nExpression...I will leave it to you to draw what you are comfortable with, but if possible, a mischievous smiling expression would be nice.\nBreasts...Please make them as modest as possible.\nUsage...Tweets with Oshino Chiyo's name, ID, and FA tag \"Nyahiart\" (may be used as a thumbnail, etc.)\nOther...We would appreciate it if you could deliver the image in psd or png format if possible.\n\nReference image (1)...https://i.imgur.com/jzM7eGu\n\nI apologize for the length of this message.\nWe hope you will consider our proposal.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/live/IZW0BLZY4c8", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Illoshino/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2127236, "client_id": 1643235, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/67883e8f/uploads/origins/24b75ee2-382c